rltoolsR contains code ported from the following third-party sources.

Box2D v3 — https://github.com/erincatto/box2d (main branch, version 3.2.0)
Used in: src/box2d (bundled physics library). Changed for R: assertions
raise an R error and log messages go to R's error stream instead of stderr /
printf (src/box2d/src/core.c, physics_world.c, replay.c; marked "rltoolsR:").
Compiler diagnostic pragmas removed for R CMD check (src/box2d/src/timer.c,
verstable.h; marked "rltoolsR:").
