Gymnasium — acrobot, CartPole, MountainCar, Pendulum, FrozenLake, CliffWalking,
Taxi and Blackjack environments
Used in: src/env_control.cpp, acrobot (adapted by
RLtools from
https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Gymnasium/blob/v0.28.1/gymnasium/envs/classic_control/acrobot.py);
src/env_control.cpp and R/gpu_cartpole.R, cartpole (CartPole-v1, from
https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Gymnasium/blob/main/gymnasium/envs/classic_control/cartpole.py);
src/env_control.cpp and R/gpu_mountain_car.R, mountain_car and
mountain_car_continuous (MountainCar-v0 and MountainCarContinuous-v0, from
https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Gymnasium/blob/main/gymnasium/envs/classic_control/mountain_car.py
and continuous_mountain_car.py);
src/env_control.cpp and R/gpu_pendulum.R, pendulum_gym and pendulum_gym_raw
(Pendulum-v1, from
https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Gymnasium/blob/main/gymnasium/envs/classic_control/pendulum.py);
src/env_toy_text.cpp (transition tables, also used by R/resident_tabular.R),
frozen_lake*, cliff_walking*, taxi* and blackjack* (FrozenLake-v1,
CliffWalking-v1, Taxi-v3 and Blackjack-v1, from
https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Gymnasium/blob/main/gymnasium/envs/toy_text/frozen_lake.py,
cliffwalking.py, taxi.py and blackjack.py)
